Comment “belly” for links! A derm-approved reality check 👇 The evidence for pregnancy belly routines is actually pretty weak, but if you’re going to do one, here are some of the most evidence-backed ingredients to reach for:

1. Centella Asiatica - support collagen boost, elasticity, and repair 🌿
2. Hyaluronic Acid- deeply hydrates, supports elasticity💧
